### Health check
GET http://localhost:3015/health-check

### 1. GET all products
GET http://localhost:3015/api/products

### 2. POST - create a new product
POST http://localhost:3015/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 100,
  "name": "Monitor",
  "category": "Electronics",
  "price": 199.99,
  "stock": 10
}

### 3. GET all products (should include ID 100)
GET http://localhost:3015/api/products

### 4. GET single product by ID
GET http://localhost:3015/api/products/100

### 5. PUT - update the product
PUT http://localhost:3015/api/products/100
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Monitor 27 inch",
  "category": "Electronics",
  "price": 229.99,
  "stock": 8
}

### 6. GET to verify the update
GET http://localhost:3015/api/products/100

### 7. DELETE the product
DELETE http://localhost:3015/api/products/100

### 8. GET to verify deletion (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:3015/api/products/100

### Extra: validation error (expect 400, missing name)
POST http://localhost:3015/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 101
}

### Extra: duplicate ID (run request 2 twice, second call expects 409)
